# ---- Build artifacts ----
# The 6.6MB `gottage` binary was tracked and touched by 39 commits, which is why
# .git is 88MB for a 17k-line project. Root-anchored so it can never shadow a
# future pkg/gottage/. History purge of the old blobs is Phase 1 §1.8.
/gottage
/dist/
*.test
*.prof
coverage.out
coverage.html

# ---- Agent harness scratch ----
# 113 files / 2.3MB. Was protected only by .git/info/exclude, which is neither
# tracked nor shared — any reclone picked it back up.
.gnhf/

# ---- Runtime state written relative to CWD ----
# pkg/ui/model.go:145 passes a bare "user_presets.json" to NewPresetManager, so
# it lands wherever the shell happens to be. Phase 3 relocates it to a config dir.
user_presets.json

# pkg/features/presets_test.go:11 writes into the package source directory
# instead of t.TempDir(), and only cleans up on a non-panicking exit.
test_presets.json

# pkg/audio/ambient.go:55 discards the os.MkdirTemp error; on failure am.tempDir
# is "" and all five ambient WAVs are written relative to CWD.
*.wav

# ---- Editor / OS ----
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
